 61FE cL $Count-rate ratio R(|q) functions of the 654 keV and 207 keV           
 61FE2cL |g-rays exhibit an opposite phase. This is due to the different        
 61FE3cL multipolarities for the two transitions. The ratio between amplitudes  
 61FE4cL of the two R(|q) functions is -1.43 {I16}, using GEANT simulations     
 61FE5cL assuming that the 654 keV and 207 keV transition have pure M2 and M1   
 61FE6cL multipolarities estimated this ratio to be -1.30 {I6}. The good        
 61FE7cL agreement between the two ratio indicates level sequence in {+61}Fe is 
 61FE8cL indeed 3/2-(g.s.), 5/2- and 9/2+ (2004Ma80).                           
